      "dc:source": "privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n; (q) a non-corporate Commonwealth entity (within the meaning\nof the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013) not otherwise covered by this subsection that is\nresponsible for enforcing one or more laws of the\nCommonwealth.\nAustralian Information Commissioner Act 2010",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n; (q) a non-corporate Commonwealth entity (within the meaning\nof the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013) not otherwise covered by this subsection that is\nresponsible for enforcing one or more laws of the\nCommonwealth.\nAustralian Information Commissioner Act 2010",
      "cml:asserts": [
