      "values:originalText": "(1A) Subsection (1) is a civil penalty provision.\nNote:\nSection 80U deals with civil penalty provisions in this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1A) Subsection (1) is a civil penalty provision.\nNote:\nSection 80U deals with civil penalty provisions in this Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14"
