    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "14(3) At the end of section 13G",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022#sch-1-sec-14-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The amount of the penalty for a contravention of subsection (1) by\na body corporate is an amount not more than the greater of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) $50,000,000;\n\n(b) if the court can determine the value of the benefit that the\nbody corporate, and any related body corporate, have\nobtained directly or indirectly and that is reasonably\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Legislation Amendment (Enforcement and Other Measures)\nAct 2022\nNo. 83, 2022\n\nattributable to the conduct constituting the contravention—3\ntimes the value of that benefit;\n\n(c) if the court cannot determine the value of that benefit—30%\nof the adjusted turnover of the body corporate during the\nbreach turnover period for the contravention.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The amount of the penalty for a contravention of subsection (1) by\na body corporate is an amount not more than the greater of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) $50,000,000;\n\n(b) if the court can determine the value of the benefit that the\nbody corporate, and any related body corporate, have\nobtained directly or indirectly and that is reasonably\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Legislation Amendment (Enforcement and Other Measures)\nAct 2022\nNo. 83, 2022\n\nattributable to the conduct constituting the contravention—3\ntimes the value of that benefit;\n\n(c) if the court cannot determine the value of that benefit—30%\nof the adjusted turnover of the body corporate during the\nbreach turnover period for the contravention.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7044841b06ba83768ef76a5d62f0b92d86c1841adcc526e3ef346f10b512d2fc",
      "skos:note": "Maximum penalty for contravention of subsection (1)",
      "dc:description": "$50,000,000; 3 times the value of the benefit; 30% of adjusted turnover"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022#sch-1-sec-14-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "14(3) At the end of section 13G",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The amount of the penalty for a contravention of subsection (1) by\na body corporate is an amount not more than the greater of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) $50,000,000;\n\n(b) if the court can determine the value of the benefit that the\nbody corporate, and any related body corporate, have\nobtained directly or indirectly and that is reasonably\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Legislation Amendment (Enforcement and Other Measures)\nAct 2022\nNo. 83, 2022\n\nattributable to the conduct constituting the contravention—3\ntimes the value of that benefit;\n\n(c) if the court cannot determine the value of that benefit—30%\nof the adjusted turnover of the body corporate during the\nbreach turnover period for the contravention."
    },
