    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "14(5) At the end of section 13G",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022#sch-1-sec-14-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(c), the adjusted turnover of a\nbody corporate during a period is the sum of the values of all the\nsupplies that the body corporate, and any related body corporate,\nhave made, or are likely to make, during the period, other than:\n\n(a) supplies made from any of those bodies corporate to any\nother of those bodies corporate; or\n\n(b) supplies that are input taxed; or\n\n(c) supplies that are not for consideration (and are not taxable\nsupplies under section 72-5 of the A New Tax System (Goods\nand Services Tax) Act 1999); or\n\n(d) supplies that are not made in connection with an enterprise\nthat the body corporate carries on; or\n\n(e) supplies that are not connected with the indirect tax zone.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(c), the adjusted turnover of a\nbody corporate during a period is the sum of the values of all the\nsupplies that the body corporate, and any related body corporate,\nhave made, or are likely to make, during the period, other than:\n\n(a) supplies made from any of those bodies corporate to any\nother of those bodies corporate; or\n\n(b) supplies that are input taxed; or\n\n(c) supplies that are not for consideration (and are not taxable\nsupplies under section 72-5 of the A New Tax System (Goods\nand Services Tax) Act 1999); or\n\n(d) supplies that are not made in connection with an enterprise\nthat the body corporate carries on; or\n\n(e) supplies that are not connected with the indirect tax zone.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14-ss-5-logic-ltl-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14-ss-5-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14-ss-5-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fb3458b09f25c6f6e76d6759686a4a9a37f1474ad3f8ac6cc1b4eee3f04eb924",
      "skos:note": "Adjusted turnover calculation for a body corporate during a period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022#sch-1-sec-14-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "14(5) At the end of section 13G",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(c), the adjusted turnover of a\nbody corporate during a period is the sum of the values of all the\nsupplies that the body corporate, and any related body corporate,\nhave made, or are likely to make, during the period, other than:\n\n(a) supplies made from any of those bodies corporate to any\nother of those bodies corporate; or\n\n(b) supplies that are input taxed; or\n\n(c) supplies that are not for consideration (and are not taxable\nsupplies under section 72-5 of the A New Tax System (Goods\nand Services Tax) Act 1999); or\n\n(d) supplies that are not made in connection with an enterprise\nthat the body corporate carries on; or\n\n(e) supplies that are not connected with the indirect tax zone."
    },
