    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "14(7) At the end of section 13G",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022#sch-1-sec-14-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(c), the breach turnover period\nfor a contravention means the longer of the following periods:\n\n(a) the period of 12 months ending at the end of the month in\nwhich the contravention ceased, or proceedings in relation to\nthe contravention were instituted (whichever is earlier);\n\n(b) the period:\n\n(i) starting at the beginning of the month in which the\ncontravention occurred or began occurring; and\n\n(ii) ending at the same time as the period determined under\nparagraph (a).",
      "skos:definition": "(7) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(c), the breach turnover period\nfor a contravention means the longer of the following periods:\n\n(a) the period of 12 months ending at the end of the month in\nwhich the contravention ceased, or proceedings in relation to\nthe contravention were instituted (whichever is earlier);\n\n(b) the period:\n\n(i) starting at the beginning of the month in which the\ncontravention occurred or began occurring; and\n\n(ii) ending at the same time as the period determined under\nparagraph (a).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-14-ss-7-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cb48c14030beb3ad7154a5bd473fd69f71359b563d0655bde23f20a2b76dcf46",
      "skos:note": "Defines breach turnover period for contravention"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022#sch-1-sec-14-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "14(7) At the end of section 13G",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(c), the breach turnover period\nfor a contravention means the longer of the following periods:\n\n(a) the period of 12 months ending at the end of the month in\nwhich the contravention ceased, or proceedings in relation to\nthe contravention were instituted (whichever is earlier);\n\n(b) the period:\n\n(i) starting at the beginning of the month in which the\ncontravention occurred or began occurring; and\n\n(ii) ending at the same time as the period determined under\nparagraph (a)."
    },
