    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-26wu-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WU(5) Power to obtain information and documents relating to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022#sch-1-sec-26wu-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If documents are produced to the Commissioner in accordance\nwith a requirement under subsection (3), the Commissioner:\n\n(a) may take possession of, and may make copies of, or take\nextracts from, the documents; and\n\n(b) may retain possession of the documents for any period that is\nnecessary for the purposes of assessing an entity’s\ncompliance with this Part; and\n\n(c) during that period must permit a person who would be\nentitled to inspect any one or more of the documents if they\nwere not in the Commissioner’s possession to inspect at all\nreasonable times any of the documents that the person would\nbe so entitled to inspect.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If documents are produced to the Commissioner in accordance\nwith a requirement under subsection (3), the Commissioner:\n\n(a) may take possession of, and may make copies of, or take\nextracts from, the documents; and\n\n(b) may retain possession of the documents for any period that is\nnecessary for the purposes of assessing an entity’s\ncompliance with this Part; and\n\n(c) during that period must permit a person who would be\nentitled to inspect any one or more of the documents if they\nwere not in the Commissioner’s possession to inspect at all\nreasonable times any of the documents that the person would\nbe so entitled to inspect.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-26wu"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-26wu-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-26wu-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "abc025864c6e502bbee43754d794a3c7ccb838a26f82cadef58ca6e26a642bb9",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner may take possession of documents and make copies or extracts."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022#sch-1-sec-26wu-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WU(5) Power to obtain information and documents relating to",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If documents are produced to the Commissioner in accordance\nwith a requirement under subsection (3), the Commissioner:\n\n(a) may take possession of, and may make copies of, or take\nextracts from, the documents; and\n\n(b) may retain possession of the documents for any period that is\nnecessary for the purposes of assessing an entity’s\ncompliance with this Part; and\n\n(c) during that period must permit a person who would be\nentitled to inspect any one or more of the documents if they\nwere not in the Commissioner’s possession to inspect at all\nreasonable times any of the documents that the person would\nbe so entitled to inspect."
    },
