      "dc:source": "privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nMultiple contraventions\n\n(1AA) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person is a corporation; and\n\n(b) the person engages in conduct that constitutes a system of\nconduct or a pattern of behaviour; and\n\n(c) the system of conduct or pattern of behaviour results in 2 or\nmore contraventions of subsection (1).\nPenalty: 300 penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nMultiple contraventions\n\n(1AA) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person is a corporation; and\n\n(b) the person engages in conduct that constitutes a system of\nconduct or a pattern of behaviour; and\n\n(c) the system of conduct or pattern of behaviour results in 2 or\nmore contraventions of subsection (1).\nPenalty: 300 penalty units.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022-sch-1-sec-39-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "392ce460e87be73897a1697d5f35b477896d789317f95a05b71163139420cc04",
      "skos:note": "Committing a system of conduct or pattern of behaviour results in multiple contraventions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-legislation-amendment-enforcement-and-other-measures-act-2022#sch-1-sec-39",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "39 After subsection 66(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nMultiple contraventions\n\n(1AA) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person is a corporation; and\n\n(b) the person engages in conduct that constitutes a system of\nconduct or a pattern of behaviour; and\n\n(c) the system of conduct or pattern of behaviour results in 2 or\nmore contraventions of subsection (1).\nPenalty: 300 penalty units."
    },
